TPBench: A Turning-Point Benchmark for Dialogue Compression
Research benchmark artifact, released 2026.

Required Notice: Copyright 2026 KENTECH Sustainable AI Laboratory, Korea Institute of Energy Technology (https://github.com/kentech-sail/TPBench)

This artifact is released under multiple licenses depending on the file class.

1. Code (scripts/, run_all.sh), aggregate result JSONs (results/**/*.json),
