   files (croissant.json, dataset_card/croissant.json), and the documentation:
   PolyForm Noncommercial License 1.0.0
   (https://polyformproject.org/licenses/noncommercial/1.0.0).
   Full text in LICENSES/PolyForm-Noncommercial-1.0.0.txt.
   Commercial use requires separate permission from the licensor.

2. Probe data (data/probes/*.jsonl) and FMTS appendix artifacts
   (batches/fmts_refpool/*.jsonl, results/fmts_refpool/*.json) contain
   derived text from public dialogue corpora. Per-corpus terms:

     - MultiWOZ 2.2-derived:      PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0; the upstream
                                  MIT notice is retained
                                  (LICENSES/MultiWOZ_2.2.txt)
     - SGD-derived probes:        CC-BY-SA-4.0, as required by the upstream
                                  share-alike terms (LICENSES/SGD.txt)
     - LongMemEval-KU-derived:    upstream LongMemEval-S terms
                                                (LICENSES/LongMemEval.txt)
     - RiSAWOZ-derived:           upstream RiSAWOZ terms
                                                (LICENSES/RiSAWOZ.txt)

3. Answer Equivalence-derived files (data/semantic_evaluation/ae_*) retain
